<h3 id="copiar-el-web.config-al-compilar">4.2. Copiar el <code>web.config</code> al compilar</h3>
<p>En <code>angular.json</code>, dentro de <code>architect &gt; build &gt; options</code>, se agregó <code>src/web.config</code> a la lista <code>assets</code>:</p>
<pre class=" language-json"><code class="prism  language-json"><span class="token string">"assets"</span><span class="token punctuation">:</span> <span class="token punctuation">[</span><span class="token string">"src/favicon.ico"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"src/og-image.jpg"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"src/assets"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"src/404.html"</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span> <span class="token string">"src/web.config"</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span>

